    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607022000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding, you've reached VeloFit. My name is Karen. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607030266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi Karen, I'm calling because I need to return an Aero Road Helmet I purchased.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 16307,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607036466666
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I can certainly help you with that. Do you happen to have your order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607041933332
    },
    {
      "text": "I do. It's VF-551298.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 16307,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607047599998
    },
    {
      "text": "Great, let me just pull that up... Okay, I see the order. It looks like it was delivered about 55 days ago.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607049199998
    },
    {
      "text": "That sounds about right. I wasn't sure if it was too late to send it back.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 16307,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607056533331
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, that's **no problem** at all. As long as the return is within **90 days** of delivery, you're perfectly fine. You're well within the window.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607061666664
    },
    {
      "text": "Really? That's great! I was worried I had missed the deadline. So, what do I need to do?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 16307,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607071466664
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just approved the return on my end. I am emailing a prepaid **return label** to you right now. Just print that out, stick it on the original box, and you can drop it off. Once we get the helmet back at our warehouse, you'll see a full refund in 3-5 business days.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607077533330
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow, that was incredibly easy. Thank you so much for your help, Karen!",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 16307,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607095599996
    },
    {
      "text": "You're very welcome! Was there anything else for you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607100466662
    },
    {
      "text": "Nope, that was it. Thanks again!",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 16307,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768607104599995
